              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾತ್ಸಲ್ಯ — vātsalya — \"tender affection\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜನ ವಾತ್ಸಲ್ಯ ನನಗೆ ಇನ್ನೂ ನೆನಪಿದೆ. ajjana vātsalya nanage innū nenapide. I still remember grandfather's tender love."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The love of an elder for a little one; Sanskrit vatsa is a calf."
            }
          ]
        },
