          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾತ್ಸಲ್ಯ (vātsalya) is borrowed from Sanskrit vātsalya, \"affection\" (CDIAL 11506), built on vatsala, \"fond\", from vatsa, \"a calf\"."
            }
